        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"UART3_TX_FCC\") ... (node (ref \"FCC1\") (pin \"48\") (pinfunction \"VCAP\")) (node (ref \"UART3_FCC1\") (pin \"3\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(C13-Pad1)\") ... (node (ref \"C13\") (pin \"1\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The UART3 interface cannot function correctly, and the FCC's internal core-regulator supply may be improperly decoupled, potentially preventing reliable MCU operation.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["NAVC1", "FCC1"],
      "pins": ["NAVC1.31", "NAVC1.47"],
      "nets": ["unconnected-(NAVC1-VCAP_1-Pad31)", "unconnected-(NAVC1-VCAP_2-Pad47)"],
      "observed": "Both STM32F405 VCAP pins are explicitly unconnected in the netlist.",
      "expected": "The MCU's VCAP pins require their specified external capacitors for the internal regulator; they should not be left open.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(NAVC1-VCAP_1-Pad31)\") ... (node (ref \"NAVC1\") (pin \"31\") (pinfunction \"VCAP_1\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(NAVC1-VCAP_2-Pad47)\") ... (node (ref \"NAVC1\") (pin \"47\") (pinfunction \"VCAP_2\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The NAVC MCU's internal regulator is not wired as required, so the MCU may fail to start or operate unreliably.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomalies are present: the MCU VDD pins are unconnected and the LDO output rail is separate from +3V3. The netlist also assigns FCC VCAP pins to UART3 signals and leaves required MCU VCAP connections open."
}

